flowchart TB
    subgraph Client[User device — phone, tablet or desktop]
      UI[React user interface]
      ROUTER[React Router and protected pages]
      AXIOS[Axios HTTP client]
      UI --> ROUTER --> AXIOS
    end
    subgraph Server[Node.js and Express backend]
      CORS[CORS and request parsing]
      SESSION[Session middleware]
      ROUTES[Auth, reports, claims and admin routers]
      AUTH[Route-level authentication and role middleware]
      RULES[Input validation and business rules]
      CORS --> SESSION --> ROUTES --> AUTH --> RULES
    end
    DB[(MySQL database)]
    AXIOS <-->|HTTP / JSON + HTTP-only session cookie| CORS
    RULES <-->|Parameterized SQL| DB
